  "body": "## OWNER RATIFICATION — drawdown campaign and missing exposure cap (2026-10-13)\n\n**Decision 1 — drawdown:** The €10 absolute drawdown stop remains a binding ceiling for certification campaign #351, in SIM and LIVE. The product may support a configurable drawdown threshold, but during this campaign the effective threshold must never exceed €10; a lower threshold is allowed only if validated. At reaching or exceeding the effective threshold, stop new risk. Do not confuse this drawdown threshold with the exposure/order cap, which is separately configured.\n\n**Decision 2 — missing cap:** If a mandatory exposure/order cap is absent, invalid, or unverifiable, block all new risk-increasing orders (fail-closed). Only demonstrably safe, verified risk-reducing operations may proceed. No implicit unlimited exposure or default €10 exposure cap.\n\nRecord these as owner decisions and link affected requirements/findings and tests. They do not authorize changes to protected PR #505, merge, deployment, LIVE activity, or paid AI calls. Gate A global remains NON PASS; PF-QA-02's ten mandatory cycles remain after authorized #505 merge.",
